            <div xml:id="1906_07_01_SD_LP_001">
                <p>
                    <person sex="female" role="employee">
                        <occupation>Kokerska</occupation>
                    </person>, <trait type="skill">skicklig i såväl finare som enklare matlagning</trait>, får plats <date when="1906-11-01" type="begin">1 Nov.</date> i <placeName type="employment" ref="#malmö">Malmö</placeName> hos <person sex="unspecified" role="employer">liten familj</person>. <state type="requirement">Eget rum</state>. <state type="requirement">Två månaders frihet per år</state>. Svar till 'Godt Humör' under adress <person sex="unspecified" role="mediator">S. Gumælii Annonsbyrå</person>, <placeName type="application" ref="#malmö">Malmö</placeName>. (<idno type="advertisement">G. 14561</idno>)</p>
